  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_297680_(Neo-)Forge.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures-fabric\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_585782_Fabric.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/additional-structures\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/additional-structures?logo=modrinth&label=&suffix=%20&style=flat&color=242629&labelColor=5ca424&logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/297680(266fff).svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Поддерживаемые версии\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/ycRJJk8EXV\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/523112426913267713?color=282828&logo=discord&style=flat&label=&labelColor=B6BCEA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"logo\" width=\"500\"/><br>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line_curved.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n\n## 📖 Описание\n\nЭтот мод добавляет в игру около 250 новых структур малого и среднего размера, чтобы расширить ваш мир!\n\n- поддерживает моды на генерацию биомов, такие как Terralith, Traverse, Biomes O' Plenty, Biome Bundle и другие!\n- интеграция с Mystcraft (MC 1.12)\n- настройки конфигурации для изменения значений спавна каждого типа структур! (MC 1.12)\n- работает с командой /locate\n- встроенная проверка обновлений\n- различные структуры генерируются в ванильных и модифицированных биомах в Надземном мире и Энде!\n- [Конфигурационный датапак](https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures/pages/config-datapack)\n\nХотите изменить или настроить некоторые значения структур в версиях 1.18+? [Вот как это сделать!](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures/pages/config-datapack)\n\n[Здесь вы можете найти все структуры текущей версии](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures/pages/structures)!\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<br><br>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 📷 Галерея\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/HJ3k534.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/BcQcqeI.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/mYWKb79.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/U20qUIY.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/kqG38d8.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/wDwNNl4.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/ZuLeZyF.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/Eevyyo9.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/aIJVHLA.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/7KLxZrl.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/8YVKUi0.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/bbZ7yxe.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/sGMDPw4.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/Ta7WuIM.png)\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n\n## 🗃️ Зависимости\n\n### Обязательные:\n- **Magma Core** [≥ MC 1.21.5]\n    - Предоставляет базовый код и функции, такие как проверка обновлений\n    - [CurseForge][cf_magmacore] | [Modrinth][mr_magmacore]\n\n### Поддерживаемые:\n- **Mystcraft** [MC 1.12]\n    - Добавлены символы-функции структур Additional Structures\n    - [CurseForge][cf_mc] | [Modrinth][mr_mc]\n- **Antique Atlas** [≥ MC 1.21]\n    - Маркеры на карте для некоторых структур\n    - [CurseForge][cf_aa] | [Modrinth][mr_aa]\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 🎮 Другие мои моды!\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Дополнительные Структуры\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bedrock-miner\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Bedrock-Miner/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Шахтёр Бедрока\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tool-upgrades\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ToolUpgrades/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Улучшения Инструментов\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Полная Совместимость\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customized-dungeon-loot\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/2291f5f13114f09294ce5e079f8a61b8a2617a8692e68ca453674e93f1982b62/687474703a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f427065525748442e706e67\" alt=\"Настраиваемый Лут Подземелий\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-sticks\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AdvancedSticks/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Продвинутые Инструменты\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/age-of-weapons\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/e8e1315b08a3bd1fb144ccd47488b1df4033418ad3aee01e61cc9d6e83fa55a5/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f586d324332576a2e706e67\" alt=\"Эпоха Оружия\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rune-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/RuneCraft/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Рунное Ремесло\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collectibles\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Collectibles/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Коллекционные Предметы\" width=\"85\"/></a> <br> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-gems\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ExtraGems/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Дополнительные Камни\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minetraps\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/MineTraps/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Минные Ловушки\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exo-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ExoCraft/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Экзо Крафт\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/city-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/CityCraft/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Городской Крафт\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upcycle\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Upcycle/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Апсайклинг\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lexicon\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Lexicon/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Лексикон\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nexus-battle-mode\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Nexus/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Нексус\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-detective\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/BlockDetective/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Блок Детектив\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/suspicious-pots\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Suspicious-Pots/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Подозрительные Горшки\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"line\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<br>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/ycRJJk8EXV\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/message.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Сообщение\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/github_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Github\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/xxrexraptorxx\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/kofi_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Ko-Fi\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=75131568\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/patreon_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/ycRJJk8EXV\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/discord_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://x.com/XxRexRaptorxX\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/xtwitter_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"X\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/FAQ.md\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/wikipedia_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Часто задаваемые вопросы\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n<br> <br>\n  <a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/REXRAPTOR\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/BH_REX_Bisect.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting - скидка 25% по коду: REXRAPTOR\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n\n[cf_magmacore]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magma-core\n[mr_magmacore]: https://modrinth.com/mod/magma-core\n[cf_mc]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystcraft\n[mr_mc]: https://modrinth.com/mod/mystcraft\n[cf_aa]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/antique-atlas\n[mr_aa]: https://modrinth.com/mod/antique-atlas",
